OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd light shower at first,
OL,6,Fotherwise a mainly dry but cloudy
OL,7,Fmorning. Rain will spread across from
OL,8,Fthe west from mid afternoon, turning
OL,9,Fpersistent and occasionally heavier
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will be widespread and
OL,13,Fheavy at times this evening, clearing
OL,14,Feast overnight to leave most areas
OL,15,Fdry, with only the odd light shower at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FA bright but rather breezy
OL,19,Fday with a few sunny spells between
OL,20,Flight scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
